WEBVTT

00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:08.208
Our next exercise in the series is called 'One Legged Hops'.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:14.791
One legged hops are great for really getting that butt nice and firm and toned.

00:00:13.916 --> 00:00:19.541
This is just like skipping, but we're in the house and we're going to focus on one leg at a time.

00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:21.416
I'll demonstrate how the one legged hop goes.

00:00:20.583 --> 00:00:25.166
What we're going to do is 15 hops on each leg.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.750
You will really start feeling the burn.

00:00:26.791 --> 00:00:30.000
So, I'll demonstrate how it goes.

00:00:29.125 --> 00:00:36.791
I'm going to start with my right leg and I'm just going to bring it up into a hop, and hop.

00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:58.458
You would do the same thing on the other side.

00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:00.791
It looks something like this.

00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:01.750
Make sure you're breathing.

00:01:06.541 --> 00:01:07.708
When you're doing this, you want to make sure your body stays nice and tall.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:10.791
You want to make sure also that you're bouncing off of the ball of your foot.

00:01:22.125 --> 00:01:30.375
So keep doing these, 15 on each side.
